	(text "VCO bypass follows the specific LDO network.\nDo not add a large undamped capacitor.\n100n per external power input: UG-570 p.120.\n10u at J3/K3: UG-570 p.120 (addition to Rev.A ref)."
		(at 274.3200 190.5000 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1113c9cd-028a-40fe-8a29-daebfbf0d2fc")
	)
	(text "External sources are not implemented. Each 1V3 branch requires 1.3 V; connect at the future supply origin.\nVDD_GPO must rise at least as fast as 1.3 V (UG-570 Rev.A p.120). VDD_INTERFACE must match FPGA I/O.\nCapacitor MPN, effective capacitance, ratings and footprints require selection. Place local bypass at the indicated balls.\nSources: AD9361 Rev.G Table13 pp.18-21; UG-570 Rev.A pp.120,124; FMCOMMS3 Rev.A sheets2,4."
		(at 20.3200 251.4600 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4e4c0071-30b3-42d7-a20d-44d6a84232bb")
	)
